WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.850
This query first creates daily revenue by department
Then a window

00:00:05.877 --> 00:00:11.469
SUM accumulates those daily values The frame is
explicit from

00:00:11.495 --> 00:00:17.338
unbounded preceding through the current row Run it
and watch the cumulative

00:00:17.364 --> 00:00:22.867
revenue increase within each department The
partition restarts the

00:00:22.893 --> 00:00:24.775
running total for each department
